[{"title":"别诸公往辽阳","author":"释函可","text":"一秋良可过，镇日共盘桓。\n谈寂霜犹堕，诗成月每残。\n开怀偏有限，握别恨无端。\n不出郑图外，关河各自寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45634,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同大来吉津赴启如斋","author":"释函可","text":"出门何所往，定是野僧家。\n踏破三门雪，惊残一树鸦。\n登床无别礼，堆案尽天花。\n得饱不辞去，边城日又斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45635,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和丽大师送弼臣见讯韵","author":"释函可","text":"不作金门赋，胡为匹马行。\n亲朋愁远道，生死见交情。\n望处关云黑，卧来江月清。\n早归余尚在，海角待升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45636,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同陈公叙昔有感","author":"释函可","text":"不过廿年事，还如隔数生。\n逢君寒碛话，动我渭阳情。\n乡国馀残梦，乾坤未解酲。\n独怜孤杖外，气骨自相撑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45637,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同木斋坐苏筑斋竟日","author":"释函可","text":"所谈亦何异，相共到黄昏。\n閒或翻残帙，饥惟索瓦盘。\n危微千古事，断续几人存。\n此日真堪录，寻思无一言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45638,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读李氏遗书二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"何期万死后，得见一生人。\n久识灰销骨，欣看字有神。\n每凭心口力，尽洗古今尘。\n莫恨余生晚，当时无此亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45639,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读李氏遗书二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"举世令人闷，斯人以死争。\n开眸沧海窄，点笔老天惊。\n佛祖无酸气，英雄有至情。\n遗书今尚在，再拜李先生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45640,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慰戴三病","author":"释函可","text":"三日不相见，惊闻伏枕忧。\n尪羸力已竭，号泣意无尤。\n未识趋庭乐，弥深陟屺愁。\n春残风尚劲，珍重夜添裯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45641,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜李鍊师禁足","author":"释函可","text":"人间亦何极，隐几即仙源。\n尽扫青牛迹，深藏金马门。\n閒应探药笈，静可叩天根。\n咫尺三山近，行看一鹤鶱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45642,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重送大茎","author":"释函可","text":"艰辛吾与汝，耐尽几秋霜。\n佛了无奇特，人难是久长。\n云山欣有伴，风雨忆同床。\n莫恋故乡好，相期塞菊黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45643,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重送尸林","author":"释函可","text":"欲嘱浑无语，徒将泪几行。\n乾坤双草履，来去一空囊。\n故国何从觅，寒冰已共尝。\n老人相见处，休话汝师狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45644,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送义虫省亲","author":"释函可","text":"相见复何日，相期安可忘。\n好携沙际雪，聊慰发如霜。\n不孝原非佛，寻诗颇似狂。\n濡毫题去袖，春雨正茫茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45645,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄心公二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"念子何偏切，为人念独艰。\n相期一种意，不在百年间。\n古圣了无异，高名岂是閒。\n遥知吟倦处，徙倚望他山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45646,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄心公二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"别来频雨雪，心绪近如何。\n子道承欢隔，君恩出塞多。\n高山方咫尺，白日已蹉跎。\n自有无穷事，时将访薜萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45647,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答客问","author":"释函可","text":"似此已踰分，平生我自知。\n一从得罪后，总是感恩时。\n有病还长啸，无家亦赋诗。\n尚犹愁未足，旦晚欲何为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45648,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪下有感","author":"释函可","text":"大雪真吾事，天心本至公。\n翻书甘手冷，乞食望年丰。\n旧岭花方发，平沙雁已空。\n几多未归客，对此意何穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45649,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入山寄友","author":"释函可","text":"到来方觉好，山亦厌名闻。\n世事凭萝隔，幽情与佛分。\n猿啼几树月，鹿过一溪云。\n此处真惟我，相寻未许君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45650,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中思友二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"知己从来少，况当塞雪深。\n每同开口笑，遂觉缓愁心。\n长聚亦无事，初离便不禁。\n如何此寒夜，独自卧孤岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45651,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中思友二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"相见已恨晚，更添离别心。\n几多乡国思，翻向友朋深。\n山古云常寂，天寒日易沉。\n独吟浑莫柰，钟磬自成音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45652,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诸公夜集希焦二师室","author":"释函可","text":"弟兄能爱客，老衲每来寻。\n况有同心侣，相偕彻夜吟。\n异乡消积恨，明月助清音。\n何必求仙去，花源此地深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45653,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又过希焦二师","author":"释函可","text":"好我真无为，感君此念深。\n一从初识后，数载到于今。\n狂极偏增重，离多奈独吟。\n春风留洞口，扶病更来寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45654,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金塔寺二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"人皆崇藻饰，此独尚清幽。\n共佛三间屋，连云一个牛。\n耕田供客食，开户任麋游。\n最爱前溪水，横腰一带流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45655,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金塔寺二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"人贫方彻骨，塔尚以金名。\n采蕨扶云出，寻诗蹋月行。\n断碑看字影，驯虎听经声。\n我到家常饭，因留太古情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45656,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤公书来赋答二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"书来惟说苦，问我苦如何。\n得食粗蔬足，逢人好笑多。\n拚他今便死，不尔且长歌。\n只此朝还夕，残冬亦易过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45657,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤公书来赋答二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"我有消愁法，从来肯易传。\n不归吾本尔，但饱即欣然。\n拾得丝丝命，由他泯泯天。\n为公通一线，同病故相怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45658,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自寿","author":"释函可","text":"投荒三十八，又已八年过。\n罪过随年长，閒情近日多。\n怀人添雪梦，得句上山歌。\n且自加飧好，愁颜意柰何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45659,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆昔","author":"释函可","text":"忆昔君初至，难分喜与悲。\n天边亲杖屦，雪底见须眉。\n屡读三都赋，相为一字师。\n自今酬唱隔，布袋有遗诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45660,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"儒释","author":"释函可","text":"儒释虽云异，天涯放逐同。\n五车开道路，一棒击虚空。\n梅州惭妙喜，蜀国失文翁。\n敢谓天将丧，应知吾道穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45661,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼骡三首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"淡泊幸相守，残躯赖尔扶。\n忽然辞我去，愈觉一僧孤。\n牛骥嫌同皂，风沙怯远途。\n自今能解脱，含泪奠生刍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45662,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼骡三首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"一钵同行乞，三年不厌贫。\n崎岖劳曲折，雨雪共酸辛。\n何忍抛愁骨，翻如失故人。\n言寻旧竹杖，彳亍更谁亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45663,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼骡三首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"所苦不能待，春深老渐长。\n殊形宁受畜，驯性最难忘。\n沟壑尔先俟，冰霜我独尝。\n伤心惟闭户，咫尺即羊肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45664,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"布帷","author":"释函可","text":"世事凭兹隔，高眠梦亦空。\n青编落枕上，白日在山中。\n此外无宁处，何人可与同。\n有时开放入，溪月并松风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45665,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭李给谏","author":"释函可","text":"山中愁未了，走马哭孤臣。\n白发随江水，青云逐塞尘。\n史留忠愤疏，天丧老成人。\n幸有绨袍在，年年渍泪新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45666,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和赤公寄韵","author":"释函可","text":"相见一平淡，相离偏忆君。\n每当此月夜，遥望在城云。\n大雪毋长视，狂歌恐或闻。\n岁穷宜倍慎，三嘱泪殷勤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45667,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遥送我存还巢二首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"未得临岐别，何堪话别频。\n同为黑水戍，况送白头人。\n长路悲空橐，还家失老亲。\n几多儿女泪，应为洗边尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45668,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遥送我存还巢二首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"艰难知尔最，大患在吾身。\n莫忆来时恨，偏添去路辛。\n未堪逢至戚，犹恐讶诸邻。\n巢父真无罪，牵牛饮颍滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45669,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得我存长安寄来书用前韵","author":"释函可","text":"行后予方觉，书来泪又频。\n到天还忆友，一路但依人。\n并罪归何碍，携霜散所亲。\n不须回白首，去住总皇仁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45670,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得石云居诗文","author":"释函可","text":"尚论贵只眼，平生于此深。\n共传迁史笔，谁谅许衡心。\n后死亦无恨，斯文未丧今。\n遥怜孤子意，山水有知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45671,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问雪公","author":"释函可","text":"山寒予可耐，衣薄尔何禁。\n学道身方重，论文念独深。\n长贫分鹤粒，多病到僧心。\n珍重过残腊，春来共笑吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45672,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻天公病","author":"释函可","text":"下堂犹有虑，出塞念偏深。\n不是子臣泪，全然父母心。\n或者风方劲，安能别有侵。\n加飧凭努力，春至候佳音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45673,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得木公手字","author":"释函可","text":"爱我知偏重，知予乃独深。\n时时施药石，事事入肝心。\n死骨必思肉，顽皮尚受针。\n明知此不可，又作感恩吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45674,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其一","author":"释函可","text":"山水无中外，飘云何必归。\n最嫌沙上雁，一一向南飞。\n罪大心方死，病多力渐微。\n谁持匡岳泪，来洒破僧衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45675,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其二","author":"释函可","text":"何妨卧出日，长欲语三更。\n篱外无人到，窗前有虎行。\n风微飘梵咒，云密透书声。\n只此閒同过，毋令别感生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45676,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其三","author":"释函可","text":"无事不携筇，多因访远松。\n独行深雪路，忽听隔溪钟。\n得句鸣寒谷，持云赠别峰。\n自来无定止，到处幸能容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45677,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其四","author":"释函可","text":"有言惟独语，更莫问青霄。\n衣就田塍补，柴分品字烧。\n止寻栖壑侣，不赴在城招。\n峰顶香岩寺，钟声下半腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45678,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其五","author":"释函可","text":"出郭无多路，心空觉地偏。\n一从抱病后，不敢向人前。\n鸲鹆留残石，素馨忆旧田。\n止应吾与汝，朗咏了残年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45679,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其六","author":"释函可","text":"高谈山顶月，低揖世间人。\n判就孤寒命，仍馀老病身。\n我心不可转，佛道未容真。\n何处玉渊水，惟应独问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45680,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其七","author":"释函可","text":"閒知茅宇阔，静觉野云忙。\n僻径人难觅，深山日自长。\n鹿携麋入室，雪共雨登堂。\n自起拨炉火，因烹芦菔尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45681,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其八","author":"释函可","text":"大抵长边外，三冬半是阴。\n风吹旧屋角，雪补破衣襟。\n树压枝枝重，灯寒夜夜深。\n梅前初梦醒，不柰此时心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45682,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其九","author":"释函可","text":"每日一餐足，无人白昼眠。\n寒多宁有法，懒极不须禅。\n时上岩头石，遥看林外田。\n西南日尽处，一直上孤烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45683,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十","author":"释函可","text":"生来山野性，万死不离山。\n随水偶然出，因风急复还。\n吟多长倚树，客到未开关。\n自笑顽成癖，人传老更顽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45684,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十一","author":"释函可","text":"夜半一抬首，星光尽在山。\n不能同雪化，只合揽云还。\n猿至常无候，门开且莫关。\n可怜犹有尔，识我是真顽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45685,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十二","author":"释函可","text":"率尔行将去，倦来树底眠。\n泉流时问话，鸟宿似安禅。\n霜不凋金粟，海难变砚田。\n每看敲石火，一点自生烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45686,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十三","author":"释函可","text":"如何有好日，不出又成阴。\n一任霜催鬓，毋令泪渍襟。\n林泉宁有异，天地此中深。\n竟夕寒如水，空馀一寸心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45687,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十四","author":"释函可","text":"不能效古昔，镇日为人忙。\n树影当窗直，峰岚入梦长。\n晓风轻布衲，暮雪静茆堂。\n更想峡桥畔，平分一盌汤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十五","author":"释函可","text":"展卷旧相识，全非此日人。\n明明千古意，寂寂一孤身。\n到死终无二，平生只是真。\n最怜初睡熟，又度大榕津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十六","author":"释函可","text":"本无才足恃，不是性多偏。\n沙石甘居后，冰霜独在前。\n难销檀越水，不种祖翁田。\n所以一瓢外，风吹自岁年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十七","author":"释函可","text":"五老何年见，人间隔九霄。\n黄精金井洗，苍术玉门烧。\n未遂玄沙志，翻将白纸招。\n龙津终有合，携手步山腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十八","author":"释函可","text":"拗折此孤筇，随心步步松。\n投林仍乞食，到午但闻钟。\n十年持一钵，双眼寄千峰。\n且莫临溪照，恐惊憔悴容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其十九","author":"释函可","text":"怀人几千里，每夜过三更。\n拥毳时同坐，沿阶又独行。\n不堪鸭绿色，常作虎溪声。\n更有关心处，飞云枕上生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和栖贤山居韵 其二十","author":"释函可","text":"旧山毕竟好，垂老未言归。\n遥想鹤峰上，终期华表飞。\n歌残山月白，声咽夜钟微。\n何日金轮顶，相将一振衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张弥茂赠红褐禅衣","author":"释函可","text":"空囊不羞涩，犹自念僧寒。\n顿使贫儿富，能令白骨丹。\n雪埋深易见，血洒湿难乾。\n且得残冬过，何如破衲安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮同阿字得寒字四首 其一","author":"释函可","text":"经岁无人趣，惊看腊又残。\n霜添窗纸厚，风使衲衣单。\n彻骨寒无路，扪心泪有端。\n一从汝到后，更益我辛酸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮同阿字得寒字四首 其二","author":"释函可","text":"总是冰霜地，非关我独寒。\n一身蹲雪底，双眼向云端。\n索句从朝起，烧泉到夜阑。\n此时兼此地，犹得共团圞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮同阿字得寒字四首 其三","author":"释函可","text":"细看生何用，平生厌素餐。\n泪将一岁尽，事向五更攒。\n海静三山稳，云高五老寒。\n情知强言笑，图使我心欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮同阿字得寒字四首 其四","author":"释函可","text":"抖搜十年恨，全倾大海宽。\n看人忙不了，于我竟无干。\n爆竹何曾响，蠹鱼依旧寒。\n春风迟亦到，且莫发长叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祀灶","author":"释函可","text":"灶无嫌我乞，我自厌残身。\n十载犹存舌，一瓢长傍人。\n空飧劳施主，勺水赖明神。\n此夜无须嘱，深知愧是真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"担水者","author":"释函可","text":"往来馀五里，风雪到更深。\n欲趁蛟龙卧，宁愁魍魉侵。\n丝丝尽彼力，滴滴感余心。\n因忆旧山上，飞泉到釜鬵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天公以其尊人所书扇见赠","author":"释函可","text":"艰危珍匣笥，持赠慰荒榛。\n乍展疑先晋，徐看识故人。\n老来书自圣，别久意逾真。\n前日传家信，犹然寄问频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天公赠棉衣留南塔先有此谢","author":"释函可","text":"念我寒如此，腊终犹解衣。\n数年惟破衲，一半逐云飞。\n但使存孤骨，毋令嚇翠微。\n故人恋恋意，春气透柴扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]